# redshift_default_privileges (Data Source)

Lists the default privileges of one local database, one element per owner, schema, object type, and grantee, without
taking ownership. Each element matches the identity and privileges of one `redshift_default_privilege`. See AWS
[SVV_DEFAULT_PRIVILEGES](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/redshift/latest/dg/r_SVV_DEFAULT_PRIVILEGES.html) and
[PG_DEFAULT_ACL](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/redshift/latest/dg/r_PG_DEFAULT_ACL.html).

